      "t": "In the middle of the wedding reception, Vika and Nagiyev rush into the kitchen demanding to know where the special dishes ordered by the bride and groom are. Cornered, Viktor Petrovich is forced to confess that he never wrote down the menu adjustments and forgot them completely.",
